## File 6: `lib/core/security/root_detection_service.dart`
**Finding:** 2.5 — Root Detection Bypass  
**Change:** Replaced entire file — from basic single-check to multi-layered detection

### Android: 7 Layers
| Layer | What It Checks |
|:---:|---|
| 1 | `root_checker_plus` plugin |
| 2 | `su` binary in 10 known paths |
| 3 | Magisk artifacts (`/sbin/.magisk`, etc.) |
| 4 | Frida detection via `/proc/self/maps` |
| 5 | Xposed/LSPosed/EdXposed via `/proc/self/maps` |
| 6 | Root management package directories |
| 7 | `which su` command execution test |

### iOS: 7 Layers
| Layer | What It Checks |
|:---:|---|
| 1 | `root_checker_plus` plugin (`isJailbreak`) |
| 2 | 40+ jailbreak file/directory paths (Cydia, Sileo, Zebra, Filza, checkra1n, unc0ver, Dopamine, Substrate, libhooker, etc.) |
| 3 | Sandbox escape — write test to `/private/` |
| 4 | Frida port scan (127.0.0.1:27042) |
| 5 | Cycript port scan (127.0.0.1:8556) |
| 6 | `DYLD_INSERT_LIBRARIES` environment variable check |
| 7 | Symbolic link detection on system paths |

