## Backend API Requirements

The `profile/customer_details` API needs to return these new fields:

```json
{
  "data": {
    "last_login_at": "2026-06-13T10:04:09.000000Z",
    "last_failed_login_at": "2026-06-12T17:52:00.000000Z"
  }
}
```

MPIN APIs (`/mpin/create`, `/validate`, `/change`, `/reset`) must accept 6-digit PINs.
